=== PARITY: web → native ===
  Web exports CarAnimation / ChargingBolt / BatteryFillAnimation / WheelSpin — all four
  reproduced as native glyphs. Reduce-motion: web renders each element in its final state
  (initial=false, duration:0, no pulse loop) → native collapses every GlyphAnimation to a
  0-duration non-repeating step and holds lights/wheel static. i18n keys verified present
  in the shared catalog (apps/shared/i18n/catalog/en.json + Localizable.xcstrings) as
  translation.carAnimation.{tesla,charging,loading}.

=== STATES (every branch the web source has — read end-to-end) ===
  resolving  RENDERED  framer null first-paint (web-coalesced to false) → calm static glyph.
  ready      RENDERED  resolved OS reduce-motion → full animated gallery OR reduced static.
  full/reduced motion  BOTH RENDERED + snapshot-covered via InMemory source.
  empty/error/stale/offline  N/A — the web source is a presentational module with no
